1
00:00:00,103 --> 00:00:02,593
(Arthur:)You get bit a lot.

2
00:00:04,240 --> 00:00:06,730
Let me see if I have this straight.

3
00:00:07,477 --> 00:00:10,107
You two are physicists...

4
00:00:11,448 --> 00:00:17,788
(Arthur:)...and you want me to do
a children's science show?

5
00:00:18,955 --> 00:00:19,975
(Sheldon:)Yes.

6
00:00:20,957 --> 00:00:25,157
(Sheldon:)And if there's time, take 12 pictures with us
in seasonal clothing.

7
00:00:32,068 --> 00:00:34,438
(Arthur:)You know, I'm a real scientist.

8
00:00:34,638 --> 00:00:37,968
(Arthur:)I have a PhD from Cornell University.

9
00:00:38,174 --> 00:00:40,374
(Sheldon:)Yeah, that's great.
Did you bring your puppet?

10
00:00:41,645 --> 00:00:43,805
(Arthur:)No. No.

11
00:00:45,015 --> 00:00:47,985
(Arthur:)I hate that puppet.

12
00:00:48,485 --> 00:00:50,285
(Sheldon:)Oh, no.

13
00:00:50,487 --> 00:00:56,027
(Sheldon:)How could anybody hate
Gino the Neutrino?

